Header-free mimic of libc++ std::optional, cvise-reduced from an
<optional> driver.  Instantiating the class fails to resolve its
dependent-base machinery: "found no match for symbol
'__optional_move_assign_base'" followed by "symbol '__base' is
unknown" (the member alias for the base-class template).  Gates
cpp20_map_basic_libcxx, whose conversion error ("symbol
'__null_state_' is unknown", optional line 288) is the same family.
clang++ -std=c++20 accepts (clang builtins; g++ n/a).
